<p>NOTE: 1996 net of $1.04 per share included a charge (non-operating) for state guaranty fund assessments of $2 million, or $0.09 per share, and net realized gains on investments (non-operating) of $400,000, or $0.02.</p>
<p>1996 net operating income for 1996 of $1.11 per share included two gains related to the prior year's activity. The company received a state premium tax refund of $1.1 million, or $0.05 per share, and reduced the amortization of deferred acquisition costs and other policyholder benefits by $1.4 million, or $0.06, to reflect an adjustment to the prior year's amortization based on actual experience and the company's revised best estimates.</p>
